[Event "01. Promote safely (4/8)"]
[Site "Endgame Classroom"]
[White "?"]
[Black "?"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "8/8/6P1/7P/8/8/8/5k1K w - - 0 1"]
[LineName "01. Promote safely (4/8)"]
[LineDescription "Push the pawn that reaches the queening square first, out of the king's reach."]

{[%csl Gg8,Gh8,Be2,Bf2,Be1] Two moves to a queen. Which pawn gets there first?}
1. g7 {The g-pawn goes: the black king is too far from g8 to stop it.} 1... Kf2
{[%csl Gg8,Gh8,Be3,Bf3,Bg3,Bf1,Be1,Be2]} 2. g8=Q {Queen! The black king is too
far away to take the new queen. With a queen, the win is easy from here.} *

