[Event "05. Escort them with your king (1/10)"]
[Site "Endgame Classroom"]
[White "?"]
[Black "?"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "8/1k6/8/1PP5/K7/8/8/8 w - - 0 1"]
[LineName "05. Escort them with your king (1/10)"]
[LineDescription "The king takes squares from the black king; the pawns move up when it is safe."]

{[%csl Gc8,Ba8,Bb8,Bc7,Ba7] With your king next to them, the pawns march up
together. The king goes in front or beside them and takes squares away from the
black king; the pawns move up when it is safe. King and pawns together: march
them up. Green: the queening square. Blue: the squares the black king can step
to.} 1. Ka5 {A king move: the pawns stay protected, and now Black has to move.}
1... Ka7 {[%csl Gc8,Ba8,Bb8,Bb7]} 2. c6 {The c-pawn moves up, protected by the
b-pawn.} 2... Ka8 {[%csl Gc8,Bb8,Ba7]} 3. c7 {The c-pawn reaches the 7th rank:
one more step.} 3... Kb7 {[%csl Gc8,Ba8,Bc7,Ba7] The king attacks the pawn on
c7!} 4. b6 {Up again, protected by your king. It also protects the pawn on c7,
which the king attacked.} 4... Kc8 {[%csl Gc8,Bd7,Bb7]} 5. Ka6 {Another king
move: Black has to move again.} 5... Kd7 {[%csl Gc8,Be8,Be7,Be6,Bd6,Bc6]} 6. Kb7
{Your king guards c8: now the pawn can promote safely.} 6... Kd6 {[%csl
Gc8,Bd7,Be7,Be6,Be5,Bd5,Bc5]} 7. c8=Q {Queen! Your king protects the new queen.
With a queen, the win is easy from here.} *

[Event "05. Escort them with your king (2/10)"]
[Site "Endgame Classroom"]
[White "?"]
[Black "?"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "8/7k/8/5P1K/6P1/8/8/8 w - - 0 1"]
[LineName "05. Escort them with your king (2/10)"]
[LineDescription "The king takes squares from the black king; the pawns move up when it is safe."]

{[%csl Gf8,Bg8,Bh8,Bg7] Escort the pawns to the queening square.} 1. f6 {The
f-pawn moves up.} 1... Kh8 {[%csl Gf8,Bh7,Bg8]} 2. Kg6 {A king move: the pawns
stay protected, and now Black has to move.} 2... Kg8 {[%csl Gf8,Bh8]} 3. f7+
{Check! The pawn drives the black king back.} 3... Kf8 {[%csl Gf8,Be7]} 4. g5
{The g-pawn moves up, protected by your king.} 4... Ke7 {[%csl
Gf8,Bd8,Be6,Bd6,Bd7]} 5. Kg7 {Your king guards f8: now the pawn can promote
safely.} 5... Ke6 {[%csl Gf8,Bd7,Be7,Bf5,Be5,Bd5,Bd6]} 6. f8=Q {Queen! Your king
protects the new queen. With a queen, the win is easy from here.} *

