{[%csl Gb8,Bc6,Bc5,Bc4,Ba4,Ba5]} 5. b7 {The b-pawn reaches the 7th rank,
protected by your king: one more step.} 5... Kc6 {[%csl
Gb8,Bc7,Bd7,Bd6,Bd5,Bc5,Bb5]} 6. b8=Q {Queen! Your king protects the new queen.
With a queen, the win is easy from here.} *

