Ka7 {[%csl Gb8,Ba8]} 4. b6+ {Check! The pawn drives the black king back.} 4...
Ka6 {[%csl Gb8,Bb5,Ba5]} 5. b7 {The b-pawn reaches the 7th rank, protected by
your king: one more step.} 5... Ka7 {[%csl Gb8,Ba6]} 6. b8=Q+ {Queen! Your king
protects the new queen. With a queen, the win is easy from here.} *

[Event "05. Escort them with your king (8/10)"]
[Site "Endgame Classroom"]
[White "?"]
[Black "?"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "5k2/8/8/5K2/5P2/4P3/8/8 w - - 0 1"]
[LineName "05. Escort them with your king (8/10)"]
[LineDescription "The king takes squares from the black king; the pawns move up when it is safe."]

{[%csl Gf8,Bg8,Bg7,Bf7,Be7,Be8] Escort the pawns to the queening square.} 1. Kf6
{The king goes ahead of the pawns: it clears the way and takes squares from the
black king.} 1... Kg8 {[%csl Gf8,Bh8,Bh7]} 2. Ke7 {The king leads the way
again.} 2... Kh7 {[%csl Gf8,Bg8,Bh8,Bh6,Bg6,Bg7]} 3. f5 {The f-pawn moves up.}
3... Kh6 {[%csl Gf8,Bg7,Bh7,Bh5,Bg5]} 4. f6 {The f-pawn moves up, protected by
your king.} 4... Kg5 {[%csl Gf8,Bg6,Bh6,Bh5,Bh4,Bg4,Bf5]} 5. f7 {The f-pawn
reaches the 7th rank, protected by your king: one more step.} 5... Kg6 {[%csl
Gf8,Bg7,Bh7,Bh6,Bh5,Bg5,Bf5]} 6. f8=Q {Queen! Your king protects the new queen.
With a queen, the win is easy from here.} *

