moves up, protected by your king.} 4... Kc5 {[%csl Gd8,Bb6,Bc6,Bd5,Bc4,Bb5]} 5.
d7 {The d-pawn reaches the 7th rank, protected by your king: one more step.}
5... Kc6 {[%csl Gd8,Bb7,Bc7,Bd5,Bc5,Bb5,Bb6]} 6. d8=Q {Queen! Your king protects
